{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12852","headline":"李中丞宅夜宴送丘侍御赴江东便往辰州 · 韩翃","name":"李中丞宅夜宴送丘侍御赴江东便往辰州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雪临阶夜，重裘对酒时。\n中丞违沈约，才子送丘迟。\n一路三江上，孤舟万里期。\n辰州佳兴在，他日寄新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}